    - target: {fileID: 227909857412235546, guid: d1678d411b7e67f468596dd5279fdbee, type: 3}
      propertyPath: data.title
      value: "Date: 15/\u2013/\u2013"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 227909857412235546, guid: d1678d411b7e67f468596dd5279fdbee, type: 3}
      propertyPath: data.content
      value: 'If anyone finds this note, I suppose you''ve made your way back here. Whatever your reason for coming, turn back. But if you''re stubborn enough to keep going, then I can only pray that the sacred spirits protect you.


        You don''t have to believe me, but Navin told me to ''look for the 5 unusual trees wrapped in three-colored cloth and seal them.'' Believe it or not, it''s up to you. Anyone who comes here is bound to die sooner or later anyway.


        That was everything I managed to learn from Navin before he disappeared.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
