    - target: {fileID: 227909857412235546, guid: d1678d411b7e67f468596dd5279fdbee, type: 3}
      propertyPath: data.content
      value: 'Ever since the incident in the village became headline news, no one has returned to this village. But those who know why the village was established still take turns coming here, keeping watch to prevent the power of ''them'' from spreading any further.


        Especially the Nang Tani, whose power has been growing stronger with each passing day. They must keep watch, ensuring that its roots do not spread any farther.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
